{"ID":"20240513083222-7zkt0fh","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083222-7zkt0fh","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083222-7zkt0fh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513135020-bjhcvso\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513135020-bjhcvso\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513135020-bjhcvso\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:500,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:500\u0026#125;","title":"152","type":"doc","updated":"20240515122914"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513135020-bjhcvso","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 1151px;","id":"20240513135020-bjhcvso","updated":"20240515122914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倪醫師病案紀錄    初診日期：2008/03/26"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"119-1 T, M"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"59歲，極胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"03/26/08"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 嚴重憂鬱症，服用抗憂鬱藥多年；只想吃(嗜甜食)和睡"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 癲癇(輕微)，服用抗癲癇藥物"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 睡好，有睡眠呼吸中斷症"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 大便每日行，有時隔日行"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 小便較深黃(服用維他命)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 倦怠無力"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 口渴重，喜冰冷飲"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. 不易出汗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. 雙足溫"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈洪有力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃乾白"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝區破洞多，脾區太大，肺區上下有血絲(1-2條，故癲癇不重)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陽明經熱"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石膏六兩  知母五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→去陽明經熱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"厚朴二錢  枳實二錢  大黃三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→小承氣湯，清腑實"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡三錢  鬱金五錢  黃芩三錢  龍膽草五錢("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人體熱且肝中毒素多，故重用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→清肝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天花五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→因渴重，增津液"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"澤瀉六錢  茯苓五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→利中下焦水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"遠志五錢  茯神三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→安神定志"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說：\n1."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倪師常用的疏肝四藥：柴胡  鬱金  黃芩  龍膽草  使用時機為：若患者肝中毒素多(例如可從眼診判斷)且患者無明顯寒象則要用龍膽草，一般用三錢，必要時可重用至五錢。若患者肝氣鬱結心情不暢則要用鬱金，一般用五錢必要時可至八錢。 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"知母、鬱金皆可使人心情好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}